  "notes": "{建|た}て{替|か}える is a compound verb meaning to rebuild. It combines ⟦{建|た}てる→建てる：01189_tateru⟧ (to build) and ⟦{替|か}える→替える：13399_kaeru⟧ (to replace).\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n\nNOTE: Do not confuse with ⟦{立|た}て{替|か}える→立て替える：05759_tatekaeru⟧ (to pay on someone's behalf), which has the same reading but different kanji and meaning.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{家|いえ}→家：00612_ie⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{建|た}て{替|か}える (rebuild a house)\n- ⟦{建物|たてもの}→建物：01458_tatemono⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{建|た}て{替|か}える (rebuild a building)",
